  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">COALITION FOR SUSTAINABLE DEV.LTD</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The AUNYD project has previously received funding from PMUN NY to support Kenyan Youth Delegates to participate in Ireland-supported initiatives at UNGA and ECOSOC Youth Forums. Colleagues at PMUN NY had a very positive experience with these youth leaders, including the Programme Coordinator for this project. This project will help support the position of the Embassy of Ireland as an advocate of inclusive governance, and as a development partner championing youth policy transformation in Kenya. Pending project achievements and outcomes, the Embassy will consider increasing funding to the SDGs Kenya Forum next year to strengthen our commitment to the youth engagement agenda in Kenya.</narrative>
  </description>
